.</p>\n<p>If you could pray and keep her close to your heart in the next steps of her journey on earth, I would be so honored. Her name is Anne.</p>\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 79, "score_up": 319, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u271d\ufe0f\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0UNDER GOD\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u271d\ufe0f", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToUNgUQH", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 678, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8919095, "raw_content": "", "author": "K3719er", "created": 1793716602813, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CaptSwerve", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToUNgUQH.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/CCaHBbsSIkbC.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/hVCE1xJht1OBJ5VF.jpeg", "width": 576, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "U9BMusD%00s:D%%MRjM{00M_~Wxv4ntRxaV@", "full_resolution": [4000, 3000]}, "title": "Yentlemen - my reciept.", "last_comment_created": 1793739725009, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 21, "score_up": 678, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToUNh